      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'After sleeping in front of the monitor, you''ve been transported to the
    tutorial island in the Ilha Misteriosa game that you were just playing.


    In
    this island you are going to encounter various enemies which you will have to
    fight to harvest your skills, level up and then, try to defeat the island boss
    and you will be granted permission to go back to the real world.


    There
    will be some totems around the island where you can save your progress in case
    you die. They will respawn you in their location with the stats you had when
    you saved your progress.


    If you complete all island in Ilha Misteriosa,
    you can take all the stats and skill learnt here to the real world.


    Good
    luck on your adventure!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
